{"4177400": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Shrouded", "steam_appid": 4177400, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177400/extras/f600ae37c82742c7038213c49f5004b0.poster.avif?t=1779091781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177400/extras/f600ae37c82742c7038213c49f5004b0.webm?t=1779091781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177400/extras/f600ae37c82742c7038213c49f5004b0.mp4?t=1779091781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i><br></i><strong>The Shrouded</strong> is a short PSX-style horror walking simulator focused on sudden scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up alone in an abandoned cellar with one simple objective: <strong>find all 8 books and escape</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the dark environment, a hostile presence lurks nearby. It doesn’t chase you constantly - instead, it appears unexpectedly, creating moments of tension and surprise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gameplay is simple and minimal, centered around exploration and item collection rather than complex mechanics. The experience is short, featuring a few sudden encounters and jump scares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Difficulty options allow players to adjust how threatening the entity is during the experience.<br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4177400/extras/f600ae37c82742c7038213c49f5004b0.poster.avif?t=1779091781\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_a